  "notes": [
    "Regular -AR verb with a spelling change: *c→qu* before *e*, to preserve the hard /k/ sound — affects the yo form of Pretérito Indefinido (*comuniqué*, not *comunicé*) and all of Subjuntivo Presente (*comunique, comuniques...*)",
    "Same pattern as *buscar*, *tocar*, *explicar*, *sacar*",
    "Past participle: *comunicado* (regular; also used as a noun meaning \"statement/press release\")",
    "Means \"to communicate\" or \"to convey\" — *comunicar una noticia* (to convey some news), *nos comunicamos por mensaje* (we communicate by message)",
    "Reflexive *comunicarse* means \"to communicate with each other\" or \"to get in touch\": *nos comunicamos todos los días* (we talk to each other every day)",
    "Related: *comunicación* (communication), *comunicado* (statement, bulletin)"
  ],
